{"seq":3,"slug":"fx-rate-lock-quote-ttl","title":"锁汇报价与有效期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-treasury-fx-hedging/fx-rate-settlement/fx-rate-lock-quote-ttl","wordCount":2188,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"锁汇报价与有效期\">锁汇报价与有效期</h1><p>用户在你的页面上看到&quot;1 美元 = 7.18 人民币&quot;，点击下单，三十秒后支付完成，实际换汇发生在支付完成之后。这三十秒里市场动了，如果你按支付时的实时价结算，用户看到的价和他实际拿到的价不一样；如果你按用户看到的价结算，这三十秒的市场风险由平台承担。<strong>锁汇报价</strong>（rate lock / rate hold）就是把这个选择显式化的机制：平台承诺一个带有效期的确定汇率，用户在这个窗口内成交就按承诺价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-锁汇是一份免费的期权吗\">核心概念：锁汇是一份免费的期权吗</h2><p>锁汇在经济学上<strong>是一份期权</strong>，而且是平台卖给用户的期权：用户有权利在窗口内按约定价成交，没有义务。用户只在对自己有利时行使——如果市场向有利方向移动，用户放弃锁汇、按市场价成交（或者走别的通道）；如果市场向不利方向移动，用户行使锁汇，损失由平台承担。</p>\n<p>这带来一个直接后果：<strong>锁汇的期望成本不是零，而是正数</strong>。它的成本近似等于这份期权的价值，而期权价值随波动率上升、随有效期延长而上升。所以锁汇的成本不能只按有效期线性摊薄来定价——那会低估长窗口在波动时期的成本。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LockCost</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>year</mtext></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LockCost} \\approx \\sigma \\cdot \\sqrt{\\frac{T}{T_{\\text{year}}}} \\cdot \\Phi(d) \\cdot N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LockCost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.04em;vertical-align:-1.212em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.828em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">year</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.788em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:3.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3240\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M473,2793\nc339.3,-1799.3,509.3,-2700,510,-2702 l0 -0\nc3.3,-7.3,9.3,-11,18,-11 H400000v40H1017.7\ns-90.5,478,-276.2,1466c-185.7,988,-279.5,1483,-281.5,1485c-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2c0,-1.3,-5.3,-32,-16,-92c-50.7,-293.3,-119.7,-693.3,-207,-1200\nc0,-1.3,-5.3,8.7,-16,30c-10.7,21.3,-21.3,42.7,-32,64s-16,33,-16,33s-26,-26,-26,-26\ns76,-153,76,-153s77,-151,77,-151c0.7,0.7,35.7,202,105,604c67.3,400.7,102,602.7,104,\n606zM1001 80h400000v40H1017.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.212em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是该货币对的年化波动率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是锁汇有效期，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是锁汇名义金额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Phi(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是与价内价外程度相关的因子。工程上不需要实现精确的期权定价——需要的是理解<strong>成本随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>T</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1133em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 增长</strong>这个结构性事实，并把它体现在锁汇的点差里。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么点差随有效期是平方根而非线性\">为什么点差随有效期是平方根而非线性</h3><p>因为价格的不确定性与时间的平方根成正比（随机游走的标准差性质），而不是与时间成正比。把 5 分钟窗口和 60 分钟窗口的成本按 12 倍定价会严重高估长窗成本，按线性定价又会在波动时期低估短窗成本。按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>T</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1133em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 缩放是符合机制的近似。</p>\n<h2 id=\"有效期的设计与超时释放\">有效期的设计与超时释放</h2><p>有效期（TTL）是锁汇的核心参数，它在两个方向用力：<strong>窗口太短</strong>，用户体验差（用户还没输完卡号就过期）；<strong>窗口太长</strong>，平台承担的市场风险大且额度被无效占用。典型的有效期在几十秒到几分钟之间，具体值取决于支付方式的完成时间——卡支付快，银行转账慢，不同支付方式需要不同的 TTL。</p>\n<p>TTL 到期的正确行为是<strong>释放锁汇额度并让报价失效</strong>，而不是静默续期。静默续期意味着平台在未重新定价的情况下继续承担风险，且用户拿到的是一个过期的价。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;quote_id&quot;: &quot;QL-2026-09-27-8812&quot;,&#10;  &quot;pair&quot;: &quot;USDCNY&quot;,&#10;  &quot;side&quot;: &quot;SELL_USD&quot;,&#10;  &quot;notional_usd&quot;: &quot;25000.00&quot;,&#10;  &quot;locked_rate&quot;: &quot;7.18420&quot;,&#10;  &quot;client_spread_bps&quot;: &quot;35&quot;,&#10;  &quot;issued_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T09:14:02.118Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;expires_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T09:16:02.118Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ttl_seconds&quot;: 120,&#10;  &quot;state&quot;: &quot;ACTIVE&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rate_ref&quot;: { &quot;tick_id&quot;: 771204, &quot;mid_at_issue&quot;: &quot;7.15890&quot; },&#10;  &quot;reserved_limit_id&quot;: &quot;LIM-USD-20260927-31&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"quote_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"QL-2026-09-27-8812\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pair\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USDCNY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"side\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SELL_USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"notional_usd\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"25000.00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"locked_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"7.18420\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"client_spread_bps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"35\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"issued_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T09:14:02.118Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expires_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T09:16:02.118Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ttl_seconds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ACTIVE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rate_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tick_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">771204</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mid_at_issue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"7.15890\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reserved_limit_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LIM-USD-20260927-31\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"状态机与并发\">状态机与并发</h3><p>状态机是 <code>ACTIVE → CONSUMED | EXPIRED | CANCELLED</code>。这里的并发风险是<strong>双重消费</strong>：用户同时在两个标签页确认，或者客户端重试，导致同一份锁汇被用于两笔交易。防御手段是消费时对 <code>quote_id</code> 做原子状态转换（<code>UPDATE ... WHERE state=&#39;ACTIVE&#39;</code> 并检查影响行数），而不是先读后写。</p>\n<h3 id=\"过期清理不能靠定时扫描单干\">过期清理不能靠定时扫描单干</h3><p>一个每小时扫描一次过期锁汇的任务，会让过期的额度最长多占用一小时。正确做法是双轨：<strong>查询时惰性判定</strong>（读到 <code>expires_at &lt; now()</code> 就视为过期，不依赖后台任务）+ <strong>后台任务做额度归还</strong>（把释放的额度还回池子）。惰性判定保证正确性，后台任务保证额度利用率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锁汇额度与风险敞口\">锁汇额度与风险敞口</h2><p>锁汇不是无限制提供的。每一份未过期的锁汇都是平台的一份潜在敞口：如果用户行权，平台要按锁定价成交，而平台自己的对冲价是市场价。所以锁汇池必须有<strong>额度上限</strong>，且这个上限要与平台的风险限额对齐。</p>\n<p>额度的管理有三个层次：<strong>单笔上限</strong>（防止单笔异常大额）、<strong>客户或渠道上限</strong>（防止单一渠道集中）、<strong>全局上限</strong>（防止总量超过风险容忍度）。三层中任何一层触顶，新的锁汇请求应被拒绝或降级为不带锁汇的实时报价。</p>\n<h3 id=\"锁汇敞口要并入净敞口计算\">锁汇敞口要并入净敞口计算</h3><p>未过期的锁汇构成一个条件敞口：只有在用户行权时才实现，但期望值非零。严谨的做法是按行权概率给锁汇敞口加权后并入 <a href=\"../cash-position-exposure/net-fx-exposure-compute\">净外汇敞口口径与计算</a> 的预测层。行权概率可以从历史数据估计——它随锁汇价与市场价的偏离程度变化（偏离越大，行权概率越高，因为用户越有利可图）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"锁汇与对冲的边界\">锁汇与对冲的边界</h3><p>锁汇窗口通常只有几分钟，且绝大多数锁汇要么被行使（平台随即在市场上结汇，敞口被平掉）要么过期（敞口消失）。所以锁汇敞口的<strong>持有时间极短</strong>，平台一般不为锁汇单独做衍生品对冲，而是把它并入当日的即期结汇量统一处理，见 <a href=\"spot-conversion-execution\">即期结汇执行与最佳执行</a>。这与第三章的远期对冲有本质区别：远期的持有期是数月，必须单独建模与估值，见 <a href=\"../hedging-instruments/forward-option-instrument\">远期与期权对冲合约建模</a>。</p>\n<p>判断&quot;要不要为某类锁汇单独对冲&quot;有一个可用的经验准则：<strong>看它的持有期与规模之和是否超过日内的自然波动容忍度</strong>。如果某类锁汇（比如大额对公客户的批量结汇锁汇）持有期长达数小时且日均规模可观，它就值得被单独度量并纳入日内的市场风险管理，而不是简单并入日均量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"锁汇敞口有两个方向的风险\">锁汇敞口有两个方向的风险</h3><p>锁汇对平台的风险不是单向的。用户行使锁汇时，平台按锁定价成交、随即在市场结汇——如果市场在这几分钟里向不利方向移动，平台的结汇成本高于锁定价，差额是损失。但如果市场向有利方向移动，用户的锁汇价低于市场价，用户更可能不行使，平台的这份损失就不会发生。所以锁汇的<strong>实际成本取决于&quot;行权时的市场偏离&quot;与&quot;行权概率&quot;的联合分布</strong>，而不是任何单一时点的差价。这也是为什么锁汇定价必须考虑波动率而不是只看当前点差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"报价的生成与定价\">报价的生成与定价</h2><p>锁汇报价不是&quot;市场价加一个固定点数&quot;，而是<strong>市场价 + 有效期成本 + 客户分层点差 + 安全边际</strong>。四个部分各有来源，且必须能被单独审计。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成部分</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>决定因素</th>\n<th>调整频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>市场中间价</td>\n<td>汇率源</td>\n<td>市场</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有效期成本</td>\n<td>期权近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><msqrt><mi>T</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma\\sqrt{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1133em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>波动率、TTL</td>\n<td>随波动率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户分层点差</td>\n<td>商业政策</td>\n<td>客户等级、渠道</td>\n<td>每日或按政策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全边际</td>\n<td>风险政策</td>\n<td>风险容忍度</td>\n<td>按政策变更</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户请求报价] --&gt; B[读取市场中间价 tick]&#10;    B --&gt; C[计算有效期成本 σ√T]&#10;    C --&gt; D[加载客户分层点差]&#10;    D --&gt; E[加安全边际]&#10;    E --&gt; F{额度是否可用}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[拒绝锁汇 降级实时报价]&#10;    F --&gt;|是| H[预占额度 生成 quote ACTIVE]&#10;    H --&gt; I{用户确认}&#10;    I --&gt;|在TTL内确认| J[原子消费 状态转 CONSUMED]&#10;    I --&gt;|超时| K[惰性判定 EXPIRED 后台归还额度]&#10;    J --&gt; L[进入结汇执行]\">graph TD\n    A[用户请求报价] --&gt; B[读取市场中间价 tick]\n    B --&gt; C[计算有效期成本 σ√T]\n    C --&gt; D[加载客户分层点差]\n    D --&gt; E[加安全边际]\n    E --&gt; F{额度是否可用}\n    F --&gt;|否| G[拒绝锁汇 降级实时报价]\n    F --&gt;|是| H[预占额度 生成 quote ACTIVE]\n    H --&gt; I{用户确认}\n    I --&gt;|在TTL内确认| J[原子消费 状态转 CONSUMED]\n    I --&gt;|超时| K[惰性判定 EXPIRED 后台归还额度]\n    J --&gt; L[进入结汇执行]</pre><h3 id=\"报价条目必须留存基准证据\">报价条目必须留存基准证据</h3><p><code>rate_ref.tick_id</code> 指向生成报价时用的那条汇率记录。没有它，&quot;为什么这个用户拿到 7.18420 而另一个拿到 7.18380&quot;会变成无法回答的问题；有了它，差异可以被归因到中间价时点、客户分层还是安全边际。这个证据链与 <a href=\"fx-rate-source-spread\">汇率源、点差与中间价</a> 里讲的不可变汇率流是同一个体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>锁汇是平台卖给用户的免费期权，期望成本为正，随波动率与有效期的平方根增长，因此不能按有效期线性定价。</li>\n<li>TTL 是有两向成本的参数，应按支付方式分别设定；到期必须释放额度并让报价失效，绝不静默续期。</li>\n<li>消费锁汇要防双重消费：用原子状态转换而非先读后写；过期用&quot;查询惰性判定 + 后台归还额度&quot;双轨。</li>\n<li>锁汇敞口有三层额度（单笔、渠道、全局），并按行权概率加权后并入预测层敞口。</li>\n<li>报价 = 中间价 + 有效期成本 + 客户分层点差 + 安全边际，四部分可单独审计，且必须留存生成时的汇率证据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"锁汇报价与有效期","id":"锁汇报价与有效期"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：锁汇是一份免费的期权吗","id":"核心概念-锁汇是一份免费的期权吗"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么点差随有效期是平方根而非线性","id":"为什么点差随有效期是平方根而非线性"},{"level":2,"text":"有效期的设计与超时释放","id":"有效期的设计与超时释放"},{"level":3,"text":"状态机与并发","id":"状态机与并发"},{"level":3,"text":"过期清理不能靠定时扫描单干","id":"过期清理不能靠定时扫描单干"},{"level":2,"text":"锁汇额度与风险敞口","id":"锁汇额度与风险敞口"},{"level":3,"text":"锁汇敞口要并入净敞口计算","id":"锁汇敞口要并入净敞口计算"},{"level":3,"text":"锁汇与对冲的边界","id":"锁汇与对冲的边界"},{"level":3,"text":"锁汇敞口有两个方向的风险","id":"锁汇敞口有两个方向的风险"},{"level":2,"text":"报价的生成与定价","id":"报价的生成与定价"},{"level":3,"text":"报价条目必须留存基准证据","id":"报价条目必须留存基准证据"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"即期结汇执行与最佳执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-treasury-fx-hedging/fx-rate-settlement/spot-conversion-execution"},"next":{"title":"远期与期权对冲合约建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-treasury-fx-hedging/hedging-instruments/forward-option-instrument"}}